[00:15.50]Our reasons for joy are abundant,
[00:20.18]Like riches increasing in worth.
[00:25.14]Those precious to God from all nations
[00:29.94]Are joining us in all the earth.
[00:34.90]The joy in our heart is well-founded,
[00:39.72]With roots reaching deep in God’s Word.
[00:44.58]We daily partake of its teachings;
[00:49.14]Faith follows the things we have heard.
[00:57.18]Our causes for joy are deep-seated,
[01:06.10]Like embers that burn in our hearts.
[01:11.32]Though troubles and trials beset us,
[01:16.22]Endurance Jehovah imparts.
[01:19.78](Chorus)
[01:19.93]Jehovah our God is our joy,
[01:24.74]The work of his hands our delight.
[01:29.52]How deep are his thoughts, how great are his works,
[01:34.22]Abounding in goodness and might!
[01:44.86]We gladly behold his productions,
[01:54.72]The heavens, the sea, and the land.
[01:59.66]We gaze at the book of creation,
[02:04.52]Applauding the work of his hands.
[02:09.14]Triumphantly we now bear witness,
[02:13.65]Proclaiming the Kingdom of God.
[02:18.66]The news of its birth and its blessings,
[02:23.32]We joyously spread all abroad.
[02:37.68]Eternal rejoicing approaches,
[02:42.06]Like daylight that follows the night.
[02:46.75]The promised new earth and new heavens
[02:51.76]Will bring everlasting delight.
[02:55.19](Chorus)
[02:55.34]Jehovah our God is our joy,
[02:59.96]The work of his hands our delight.
[03:04.54]How deep are his thoughts, how great are his works,
[03:09.20]Abounding in goodness and might!
